        "raw": "After some extensive playing and introduction to the game to new players (who loves it, btw), I seemed to have lost a card from the Insula Primalis environment deck somewhere because I only counted 14 cards in that deck. Been looking for it for the past few days and it never turned up. The problem is I have no idea what card is missing because I couldn&#39;t find any card list for environment decks. My current count of the deck consists of the following:\n\n3x Obsidian Field\n\n2x River of Lava\n\n2x Pterodactuyl Thief\n\n3x Velociraptor Pack\n\n2x Primordial Plant Life\n\n1x Volcanic Eruption\n\n1x Enraged T-Rex\n\n...14 cards  :cry: \n\nAny help on identifying what card I&#39;m missing from Primalis Insula so that I can probably order a replacement if it still doesn&#39;t turn up? Much appreciated!",
